host-suffix, sentry.io, AI
host-suffix, datadoghq.com, AI
host-suffix, stripe.com, AI
host-suffix, workos.com, AI
host-suffix, workoscdn.com, AI
host-suffix, imgix.net, AI
host, challenges.cloudflare.com, AI

# Google Gemini
host, gemini.google.com, AI
